<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>IKEA Taiwan - Instagram 貼文模擬</title>
  <!-- 引入 Tailwind CSS 方便快速排版 -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- 引入 Lucide 圖示庫 -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 flex justify-center items-center min-h-screen p-4 font-sans">

  <!-- IG 貼文卡片主體 -->
  <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
    
    <!-- 1. 發文者 Header -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 border-b border-gray-100">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
        <!-- 大頭貼 -->
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-yellow-400 border border-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-blue-700 text-xs tracking-tighter">
          IKEA
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
            <span class="font-semibold text-sm">ikea_taiwn</span>
            <!-- 藍勾勾 -->
            <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-500 fill-blue-500 text-white"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">贊助內容</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <i data-lucide="more-horizontal" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 cursor-pointer"></i>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. 貼文圖片 -->
    <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 aspect-square">
      <!-- 可將 src 換成你自己的 IKEA 圖片連結 -->
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555041469-a586c61ea9bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="IKEA 居家展示" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
    </div>

    <!-- 3. 按鈕互動區 -->
    <div class="p-3 pb-1">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
          <i data-lucide="heart" class="w-6 h-6 cursor-pointer hover:text-red-500 transition"></i>
          <i data-lucide="message-circle" class="w-6 h-6 cursor-pointer hover:text-gray-600 transition"></i>
          <i data-lucide="send" class="w-6 h-6 cursor-pointer hover:text-gray-600 transition"></i>
        </div>
        <i data-lucide="bookmark" class="w-6 h-6 cursor-pointer hover:text-gray-600 transition"></i>
      </div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-sm mb-2">1,248 次按讚</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. 貼文內文 -->
    <div class="px-3 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">
      <span class="font-semibold mr-2">ikea_taiwn</span>新年到了，是時候為家裡換上新的生活風格！

✨ 簡約北歐設計 
✨ 寶用居家用品 
✨ 舒適生活空間 
✨ 美好新年生活

簡約的設計，讓生活更簡約；寶用的生活，讓居家更寶用；舒適的家，讓生活更加舒適。新年換新家，新家換新生活，新生活帶來新的美好，美好的新生活讓家變得更美好。

趁著過年季節出清，把喜歡的居家用品帶回家，讓家更整齊整齊，讓生活更舒適舒適，讓新年生活美好又美好。

IKEA，讓家更美好，讓生活更美好，讓家與生活一起美好。

📅活動期間：即日起至10/31
數量有限，要買要快！！

<span class="text-blue-900 font-normal">#IKEA #過年出清 #新年換新家 #簡約生活 #居家生活 #寶用生活</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 發布時間 -->
    <div class="px-3 mt-2 mb-3">
      <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wide">2 天前</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 5. 留言區 -->
    <div class="border-t border-gray-100 p-3 bg-gray-50/50 space-y-3">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 mb-2">留言 (2)</p>

      <!-- 顧客留言 -->
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-2 text-sm">
        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-gray-300 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-gray-600 font-bold">
          C
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 flex-1 shadow-2xs">
          <span class="font-semibold text-xs block text-gray-900 mb-0.5">👤 顧客</span>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-xs leading-normal">
            小編～想問一下，這次過年出清是到幾號呀？我想週末再過去逛逛～
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 小編回覆 -->
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-2 text-sm pl-6">
        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-yellow-400 border border-blue-600 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-700">
          IKEA
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50/60 p-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 flex-1 shadow-2xs">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 mb-0.5">
            <span class="font-semibold text-xs text-gray-900">💙💛 IKEA 小編</span>
            <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="w-3 h-3 text-blue-500 fill-blue-500 text-white"></i>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-xs leading-normal">
            嗨～這次過年出清活動會到 2/15 喔！✨
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    // 初始化 Lucide 圖示
    lucide.createIcons();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
